只输出严格JSON，恰好包含id（metadata.id原样）、summary_zh（15到140个Unicode字符，通常40到100字）、category（枚举）、tags（2到5个不重复关键词，每个最多30字符）、confidence（0到1，仅自评）、insufficient_evidence（布尔）、evidence（1到3个对象，每个恰好包含paragraph_id、fact）、limitations（0到5个字符串）。只选择输入中长度20至120字符的完整片段编号；fact是该片段支持的中文事实转述。不要输出quote，不要自行抄写、拼接、删改或补造引用。程序会按编号附上原文。一个编号只用一次；最多3条证据。不得增加字段。
摘要和limitations保留会改变功能意义的前提、平台例外和限制：设密码后才认证、页面保持打开才提醒、依赖外部组件、估算不等于保证。只写已实现功能，不将规划当完成。证据不足就标记，不编造。
图像识别/分类不是媒体创作，没有贴切类别归other；量化、计算与领域研究归search-research，不因多智能体实现归agents-automation；模型/CLI适配与插件开发工具归coding-development；市场/精选目录按搜索发现归search-research。不要按附属同步、备份或评论功能分类。不要推断本机客户端等于本地模型。
摘要中的主要功能必须被所选片段支持。优先把改变用途含义的条件写进摘要，不能只藏在limitations。遇到“阶段1骨架”“cloud provider待实现”“匿名thread后续实现”等，摘要明确当前仅本地草稿/审批落盘，不说已实现匿名网络或云端发布。Codex/模型登录适配归coding-development；Oopz等语音房的对话连接归communication-integrations。自述兼容或性能用“作者称/README注明”，不冒充本次验证。
格式示例（仅结构，不是来源事实）：evidence:[{"paragraph_id":"p3s1","fact":"该片段支持的中文转述"}]。请从本次真实输入挑选编号。","role":"system"},{"content":"{"metadata":{"description":"Inline ECharts rendering plugin for DeepSeek Harness","id":"gh:1335079681","install_available":true,"language":"JavaScript","name":"dsh-artifact","slug":"sumarilkkxx/dsh-artifact","topics":["dsh","dsh-plugin","dsh-plugin-market","dsh-plugins"]},"paragraphs":[{"id":"p1s1","text":"Inline ECharts rendering plugin for DeepSeek Harness"},{"id":"p2s1","text":"Turn natural-language requests into native, interactive ECharts and Mermaid visualizations inside De"},{"id":"p2s2","text":"nguage requests into native, interactive ECharts and Mermaid visualizations inside DeepSeek Harness."},{"id":"p3s1","text":"简体中文"},{"id":"p4s1","text":"## What it is"},{"id":"p5s1","text":"`dsh-artifact` is a visualization renderer for DeepSeek Harness. Ask for a chart or diagram in ordin"},{"id":"p5s2","text":"ary language; the model understands the intent, chooses the appropriate native engine, emits a decla"},{"id":"p5s3","text":"rative payload, and the result appears directly in the conversation as an interactive canvas."},{"id":"p6s1","text":"It is built for a near-native ECharts and Mermaid authoring experience—not a small set of hand-drawn"},{"id":"p6s2","text":" chart templates. The browser receives a real ECharts option or Mermaid source and renders it with t"},{"id":"p6s3","text":"s. The browser receives a real ECharts option or Mermaid source and renders it with the real engine."},{"id":"p7s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p8s1","text":"## Highlights"},{"id":"p9s1","text":"### From a request to a native canvas"},{"id":"p10s1","text":"Describe the visualization you need in ordinary language. `dsh-artifact` keeps the complete workflow"},{"id":"p10s2","text":" inside the conversation: the model reasons about the request, prepares a native engine payload, and"},{"id":"p10s3","text":" renders the result as an interactive canvas with appearance controls and PNG export."},{"id":"p11s1","text":"One request, from streamed reasoning and tool execution to a native ECharts calendar heatmap. The de"},{"id":"p11s2","text":"monstration preserves the actual DeepSeek Harness interface."},{"id":"p12s1","text":"### Built around real rendering engines"},{"id":"p13s1","text":"| | Capability |"},{"id":"p14s1","text":"| **Native engines** | ECharts 6, the official ECharts-GL extension when an option needs it, and Mer"},{"id":"p14s2","text":"maid 11 |\n| **Broad ECharts coverage** | Native JSON-expressible series and components: cartesian, p"},{"id":"p14s3","text":"ie, radar, calendar heatmap, graph, sankey, tree, map, parallel, timeline, `dataset`, `visualMap`, `"},{"id":"p14s4","text":"dataZoom`, and more |\n| **Diagram-first Mermaid** | Flowcharts, sequence, class, state, ER, gantt, j"},{"id":"p14s5","text":"ourney, pie, and other Mermaid-supported diagrams |\n| **Interactive canvas** | Tooltips, legends, zo"},{"id":"p14s6","text":"om, pan, 3D controls, and responsive resizing come from the actual renderer |\n| **Appearance control"},{"id":"p14s7","text":"s** | In-canvas ECharts-inspired palettes and light/dark backgrounds; photographic globes retain the"},{"id":"p14s8","text":"ir real-world surface and expose background mode only |\n| **Image download** | Download ECharts, ECh"},{"id":"p14s9","text":"arts-GL, and Mermaid canvases as 2× PNG images using the active background; standard ECharts and Mer"},{"id":"p14s10","text":"maid diagrams also support SVG download |\n| **Safe by design** | Pure JSON across the declarative bo"},{"id":"p14s11","text":"undary; isolated custom HTML runs in a CSP-restricted sandbox iframe |"},{"id":"p15s1","text":"## Install"},{"id":"p16s1","text":"Install the DeepSeek Harness CLI first (one time):"},{"id":"p17s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p18s1","text":"If this is your first time using DSH, run `dsh web` once to initialize the web profile, then stop it"},{"id":"p18s2","text":" before adding the plugin."},{"id":"p19s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p20s1","text":"Start or restart `dsh web`, then hard-refresh the browser (`Cmd/Ctrl+Shift+R`). `pnpm` must be avail"},{"id":"p20s2","text":"able on `PATH` because the DSH plugin command uses it internally."},{"id":"p21s1","text":"## Use it naturally"},{"id":"p22s1","text":"Ask for the result you need. For example:"},{"id":"p23s1","text":"> Compare quarterly revenue and margin for 2024 in a dual-axis chart, highlight the best quarter, an"},{"id":"p23s2","text":"d use a dark canvas."},{"id":"p24s1","text":"> Create a GitHub-style calendar heatmap for this year's daily commits."},{"id":"p25s1","text":"> Draw a sequence diagram for OAuth login with success and failure paths."},{"id":"p26s1","text":"The model calls `render_artifact` and returns a live canvas in the conversation. Use the **Appearanc"},{"id":"p26s2","text":"e** control to switch palette/background where appropriate, and the adjacent **Download** action to "},{"id":"p26s3","text":" to switch palette/background where appropriate, and the adjacent **Download** action to save a PNG."},{"id":"p27s1","text":"## Engine contract"},{"id":"p28s1","text":"### `render_artifact`"},{"id":"p29s1","text":"| Parameter | Type | Purpose |"},{"id":"p30s1","text":"| `engine` | string | `echarts` (default) or `mermaid` |\n| `option` | object / string | A native ECh"},{"id":"p30s2","text":"arts option for `echarts`; pure JSON only, no JavaScript functions |\n| `maps` | object / string | Op"},{"id":"p30s3","text":"tional legal GeoJSON/SVG registry for ECharts `geo` and `map` visualizations |\n| `code` | string | M"},{"id":"p30s4","text":"ermaid source for `mermaid` |\n| `theme` | string | `auto`, `tech-blue`, `minimal`, `night-purple`, `"},{"id":"p30s5","text":"forest`, or `amber` |\n| `mode` | string | `auto`, `light`, or `dark` |\n| `title` | string | Conversa"},{"id":"p30s6","text":"tion card title |\n| `height` | number | Canvas height in px (default `360`, minimum `120`) |"},{"id":"p31s1","text":"The plugin passes ECharts options to `setOption` without translating them into a preset catalogue. E"},{"id":"p31s2","text":"xplicit values in an option take precedence over the in-canvas theme, exactly as they do in ECharts."},{"id":"p31s3","text":" ECharts-GL is loaded only when a supported 3D option requires it; it remains an ECharts compatibili"},{"id":"p31s4","text":"ty layer, not a separate 3D scene editor."},{"id":"p32s1","text":"JavaScript callbacks cannot cross the JSON security boundary. Prefer ECharts string templates such a"},{"id":"p32s2","text":"s `{c}%` for formatters. For genuinely callback-driven custom experiences, use `render_html`."},{"id":"p33s1","text":"### `render_html`"},{"id":"p34s1","text":"| Parameter | Type | Purpose |"},{"id":"p35s1","text":"| `html` | string | Self-contained HTML fragment or document; inline CSS/JS is allowed |\n| `title` |"},{"id":"p35s2","text":" string | Conversation card title |\n| `height` | number | Canvas height in px (default `400`, minimu"},{"id":"p35s3","text":"Conversation card title |\n| `height` | number | Canvas height in px (default `400`, minimum `120`) |"},{"id":"p36s1","text":"`render_html` is the deliberately separate escape hatch for custom widgets. It runs in an opaque-ori"},{"id":"p36s2","text":"gin iframe with a CSP that blocks network access, top-level navigation, and form submission. Its con"},{"id":"p36s3","text":"tents cannot be exported by the host, so it intentionally has no PNG download control."},{"id":"p37s1","text":"## Native ECharts example"},{"id":"p38s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p39s1","text":"## Security and compatibility"},{"id":"p40s1","text":"- The declarative payload is validated as lossless JSON. Functions, `undefined`, and symbols are rej"},{"id":"p40s2","text":"ected.\n- Engine assets are served only from the plugin route; traversal attempts are blocked.\n- Map "},{"id":"p40s3","text":"visualizations must include legal GeoJSON/SVG through `maps`; the plugin never fetches map data from"},{"id":"p40s4","text":" the network.\n- The plugin ships its renderer assets locally, so ECharts and Mermaid render without "},{"id":"p40s5","text":"he plugin ships its renderer assets locally, so ECharts and Mermaid render without a CDN dependency."},{"id":"p41s1","text":"## Development"},{"id":"p42s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p43s1","text":"| Path | Description |"},{"id":"p44s1","text":"| `index.js` | Host tool definitions, validation, prompt guidance, and local asset route |\n| `client"},{"id":"p44s2","text":".js` | DeepSeek Harness toolviews, renderer dispatch, appearance controls, and PNG export |\n| `asset"},{"id":"p44s3","text":"s/` | Committed ECharts, ECharts-GL, Mermaid, and project media assets |\n[该节后续省略]"}],"truncated":true}","role":"user"}],"model":"MiniMax-M3.1-Flash","reasoning_effort":"low","stream":false}
